dv:invoice_grossInvoiceAmount rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "gross invoice amount" ;
    rdfs:comment "The invoice total CHARGED TO THE CLIENT, inclusive of MSP margin and before tax. AME003 repeats this on every line and AME008 asserts the lines sum to it -- so this column is the reconciliation target, not a convenience copy. Settled 24 September 2026: the client total is what Ameren is invoiced, and the supplier total (gross_supplier_invoice_amount) is the underlying cost. The two differ by the MSP margin, measured at 24,054.04 across 380 of 419 invoices. Masked by governance.mask_money." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    dv:sqlType "DECIMAL(18,2)" ;
    dv:classification "financial" ;
    dv:maskFunction "governance.mask_money" ;
    dv:sourceTable "sat_invoice_header_fieldglass_us_rev1" .

dv:invoice_invoiceBk rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "invoice bk" ;
    rdfs:comment "The business key of this hub in readable form, for a human reading a row. Never joined on -- invoice_hk is the join." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "hub_invoice_rev1" .

dv:invoice_invoiceReference rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "invoice reference" ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "hub_invoice_rev1" .

dv:invoice_invoiceSubmitDate rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "invoice submit date" ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "sat_invoice_header_fieldglass_us_rev1" .

dv:invoice_invoiceTenant rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "invoice tenant" ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "hub_invoice_rev1" .

dv:invoice_invoiceType rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "invoice type" ;
    rdfs:comment "Fieldglass invoice type, IN in the sample. Retained because a credit note is a different document and must not be released as an invoice." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "sat_invoice_header_fieldglass_us_rev1" .

dv:invoice_netInvoiceAmount rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "net invoice amount" ;
    rdfs:comment "THE SOURCE'S NAMES ARE INVERTED AND THIS IS THE LARGER FIGURE. Despite being called \"net\", this is the invoice total INCLUDING tax: measured across all 419 real invoices, net_invoice_amount = gross_invoice_amount + invoice_adjustment_amount, without exception. Independently confirmed by Amy Keser's `Ameren Invoice Value Analysis` of 24 September, which reaches the same reading from the client's own figures. The columns keep the source's spelling because the raw vault records what the source sent; this description is where the trap is named, because only 2 of the 419 invoices carry any tax, so on the other 417 the two columns are equal and the inversion is invisible. Masked by governance.mask_money." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    dv:sqlType "DECIMAL(18,2)" ;
    dv:classification "financial" ;
    dv:maskFunction "governance.mask_money" ;
    dv:sourceTable "sat_invoice_header_fieldglass_us_rev1" .

dv:invoice_originalInvoiceId rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "original invoice id" ;
    rdfs:comment "Present when this invoice supersedes another. Carried so a reissue can be distinguished from a first issue, which the issuance ledger in Task 6 needs." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:Invoice ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "sat_invoice_header_fieldglass_us_rev1" .

dv:invoiceLine_accountingDate rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "accounting date" ;
    rdfs:comment "AME009 -- from the week-ending date. See the open question on its format." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:InvoiceLine ;
    dv:typeUndeclared "true" ;
    dv:sqlType "source-derived" ;
    dv:classification "internal" ;
    dv:sourceTable "csat_invoice_line_gie_rev1" .

dv:invoiceLine_amount rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "amount" ;
    rdfs:comment "AME008 -- the line amount for an ITEM line, being the CLIENT amount: invoice_line_item_amount_client from the raw vault, which is the supplier cost plus that line's MSP margin. Not the supplier figure. Tax is aggregated onto the final TAX line and all lines sum to the invoice gross. Named `amount` because Ameren's template names the column `Amount`; the thirteen gold field names are the customer's contract and are not ours to rename. Masked by governance.mask_money." ;
    rdfs:domain dv:InvoiceLine ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    dv:sqlType "DECIMAL(18,2)" ;
    dv:classification "financial" ;
    dv:maskFunction "governance.mask_money" ;
    dv:sourceTable "csat_invoice_line_gie_rev1" .

